 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? If you hire someone early and they plan everything carefully, yes. A cheap planner can save you far more than they cost. That's exactly the kind of couple they help the most. A plan makes everything run much smoothly. Most couples plan about three to four months ahead, so most of the big decisions are made before the big day. It is if you don't want stress, which drops the value of the planner nicely. You can do it yourself and just hire them on day. Most couples hire them later, after the big decisions are made. And you can always drop them at any point.",
